assets/crew/henry.png
assets/crew/red.png
assets/crew/simon.png

# Working files, not part of the site.
#
# The repo root IS the deploy root on this project, so anything sitting here is
# served on the public internet unless it is listed below. It was: NAOMI-TODO.md,
# SESSION-HANDOVER.md and TODO.md were all readable at
# https://www.clearedfortakeoff.com.au/NAOMI-TODO.md, and between them they
# published the automation server's IP address and the ssh command to reach it,
# plus internal notes on pricing and refunds. Only two of the six docs had ever
# been listed here. No page links to a .md file, so every one of them is excluded
# by pattern rather than by name, which is the part that stays correct when
# someone adds the seventh document.
*.md
course-content/
marketing/

# Build inputs, not outputs. tools/ and partials/ generate the pages; shipping
# them exposed the site's own config (prices.json, book.json) and scripts.
tools/
partials/

# Superseded by assets/og-image.jpg (303KB -> 54KB)
assets/og-image.png

# Medaria Aid merch shop. Source for a DIFFERENT site (medariaaid.com), kept here
# only because this is the branch the work was done on. It must never be served from
# clearedfortakeoff.com.au.
medaria-shop/
